<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title>COD King — Thank you</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; background: #f6f6f7; color: #1a1a1a; font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; }
    .card { max-width: 520px; margin: 48px auto; background: #fff; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb; border-radius: 12px; padding: 32px 24px; text-align: center; }
    .brand { font-weight: 700; color: #ff6600; margin-bottom: 10px; }
    h1 { font-size: 22px; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    p { color: #4b5563; margin: 0 0 8px; }
    .preview { background: #fff7ed; border: 1px solid #fed7aa; color: #9a3412; border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 12px; font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 16px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="brand">COD King</div>
    <% if @preview %><div class="preview">Preview — nothing was saved.</div><% end %>
    <h1>Thank you for the feedback</h1>
    <p>Your answers go straight to the team building COD King.</p>
    <p>If you asked for a call, we'll reach out within one working day.</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
